- **REQ-AS-01** (one-to-many expansion): 6 tests — snapshot comparison, issue22 edge case, empty input guards
- **REQ-AS-02** (strategy ordering): 5 tests — Strategy 1 direct match, Strategy 2 fallback, empty inputs
- **REQ-AS-03** (dotted prefix-stripped paths): 2 tests — parametrized over all 4 PartDefs
- **REQ-AS-04** (CHAIN alias filters): 3 tests — filter verification, output format, snapshot comparison
- **REQ-AS-05/06** (registry integration): 2 tests — Phase 1b registration and Phase 2 resolution
- **REQ-AS-07** (module_eqn format): 2 tests — solar_battery (parametrized over 20) + issue22
